; workflow_worlds.eval - EditorTest phase 18, part 1 (tool-refinement Phase 7):
; new worlds that START IN A LIBRARY STYLE.
;
;   p7_world  blank, through the New world dialog, in Dirt Tunnels - the world
;             receives the style (and its themes and surfaces), its starter
;             dungeon names it, and the first room wears it
;   p7_wiz    the wizard in Marble Halls - its floor generated from the style's
;             recipe, tags and monster list, in its two themes
; tools/EditorTest.py reads the files, opens each world to run the checker, then
; walks the four stages inside p7_world (workflow_walk.eval), and removes both.

logecho on
reset
worlds newdialog source blank
worlds newdialog style dirt_tunnels
worlds newdialog create p7_world
worlds newdialog off
worlds new p7_wiz wizard style=marble_halls size=32 difficulty=0.6 seed=5
